### ActionGenerator API Tests

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8001
@apiKey = dev-key-12345

### ===== HEALTH CHECK =====
### No authentication required
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### ===== GENERATE RECONNAISSANCE ACTIONS =====
### Requires API Key in X-API-Key header
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/reconnaissance
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDepartureTime": "2025-01-29T06:00:00Z",
  "minArrivalTime": "2025-01-29T08:00:00Z",
  "maxArrivalTime": "2025-01-29T22:00:00Z",
  "minDistanceToFront": 5,
  "minSpyCount": 1,
  "maxPopulationInSourceVillage": 8000,
  "skipNightSendings": true,
  "sourceVillages": [
    "500|500",
    "501|501",
    "502|502"
  ],
  "targetVillages": [
    "600|600",
    "601|601",
    "602|602"
  ]
}

### ===== TEST WITHOUT API KEY (should fail with 401) =====
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/reconnaissance
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDepartureTime": "2025-01-29T06:00:00Z",
  "minArrivalTime": "2025-01-29T08:00:00Z",
  "maxArrivalTime": "2025-01-29T22:00:00Z",
  "minDistanceToFront": 5,
  "minSpyCount": 1,
  "maxPopulationInSourceVillage": 8000,
  "skipNightSendings": true,
  "sourceVillages": ["500|500"],
  "targetVillages": ["600|600"]
}

### ===== TEST WITH INVALID API KEY (should fail with 401) =====
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/reconnaissance
X-API-Key: invalid-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDepartureTime": "2025-01-29T06:00:00Z",
  "minArrivalTime": "2025-01-29T08:00:00Z",
  "maxArrivalTime": "2025-01-29T22:00:00Z",
  "minDistanceToFront": 5,
  "minSpyCount": 1,
  "maxPopulationInSourceVillage": 8000,
  "skipNightSendings": true,
  "sourceVillages": ["500|500"],
  "targetVillages": ["600|600"]
}

### ===== TEST VALIDATION - Invalid Time Order =====
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/reconnaissance
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDepartureTime": "2025-01-29T10:00:00Z",
  "minArrivalTime": "2025-01-29T08:00:00Z",
  "maxArrivalTime": "2025-01-29T22:00:00Z",
  "minDistanceToFront": 5,
  "minSpyCount": 1,
  "maxPopulationInSourceVillage": 8000,
  "skipNightSendings": true,
  "sourceVillages": ["500|500"],
  "targetVillages": ["600|600"]
}

### ===== TEST VALIDATION - No Source Villages =====
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/reconnaissance
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "minDepartureTime": "2025-01-29T06:00:00Z",
  "minArrivalTime": "2025-01-29T08:00:00Z",
  "maxArrivalTime": "2025-01-29T22:00:00Z",
  "minDistanceToFront": 5,
  "minSpyCount": 1,
  "maxPopulationInSourceVillage": 8000,
  "skipNightSendings": true,
  "sourceVillages": [],
  "targetVillages": ["600|600"]
}

### ===== INSTRUCTIONS =====
### 1. Start ActionGenerator API: dotnet run --project src/ActionGenerator/ActionGenerator.Api
### 2. API will run on http://localhost:8001
### 3. All endpoints (except /health) require X-API-Key header
### 4. Valid API keys are configured in appsettings.Development.json
### 5. Use this API from TWAction backend to generate actions

### API Key Configuration:
### - Development keys: dev-key-12345, test-key-67890
### - Production: Configure in appsettings.json
### - Header name: X-API-Key (configurable)

### Response Format:
### Success (200 OK):
### [
###   {
###     "sourceVillage": "500|500",
###     "targetVillage": "600|600",
###     "spyCount": 1,
###     "departureTime": "2025-01-29T07:00:00Z",
###     "arrivalTime": "2025-01-29T09:00:00Z",
###     "distance": 141
###   }
### ]

### Error (400 Bad Request):
### {
###   "error": "MinArrivalTime must be after MinDepartureTime."
### }

### Unauthorized (401):
### {
###   "error": "API Key missing"
### }
### or
### {
###   "error": "Invalid API Key"
### }
